+# Growing native formation with protected matter current
+
+**Date:** 2026-09-13
+**Type:** bounded_theorem
+**Status:** proposed_retained
+
+An explicit prepared native carrier supports a varying nearest-neighbor Record
+content law and nonzero protected matter current through arbitrarily large
+finite formation histories. A single supplied seed and a specified occurrence
+process give analytical growing-front bounds. The construction does not derive
+its state, controls, Born events, rates or clock from the framework axioms.
+Its actual current-surface status is conditional-support; independent source
+review and formal audit remain pending.
